Changes: the font file is unchanged. In the CSS, the @font-face rule now
lists a single src, url('fontawesome-webfont.woff2') format('woff2'),
instead of the eot/woff/ttf/svg sources under ../fonts/. The license
header comment is kept. Nothing else is changed.
